---
description: Decide field-level findings for assessOverlap.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Compare proposals by intended benefit, location, and required work. Identify genuine duplicates and complementary bundles without merging projects whose similar wording masks different communities or uses; obtain proposer review for material combinations. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
